MTFOTP -- Magtape FOTP

		MTFOTP.PA	Source of modified FOTP
		FOTP.SV		Save image of MTFOTP
		MAGTAP.HL	Documentation file (attached)
		TM8EZ.PA	9-track OS/8 handler
		TM8EZ.BN	Binary of TM8EZ for BUILD
		TM8ESU.PA	Extended code for TM8EZ
		TM8ESU.SV	Save image of TM8ESU (must be on
				SYS: for TM8EZ to function)
		DIROVL.PA	Overlay to DECUS DIRECT (8-842)
				to add magtape directory capability
		DIRECT.SV	Save image of 8-842 with DIROVL

USR -- and Other Subroutines for Fortran IV

		USR1.RA		Revised file lookup program for Fortran IV
		READB4.RA	READB, WRITEB, & RLINK
		MODE8.RA	Linkage between Fortran IV and
				8-mode subroutines
		IOT.RA		Execute 8-mode IOT's from Fortran IV
		TV.RA		Display ASCII on PDP-12 scope in
				background during Fortran IV
		NULL.PA		TVIN handler for scope I/O in Fortran IV
				on the PDP-12
		F4SUBS.HL	Documentation of subroutines available
		USR.HL		Documentation of USR.RA

PREVU & PLOTIT -- Background Plotting for Fortran IV

		PREVU.RA	Previews plots on a storage scope
		PLOTIT.RA	Plots queued plots in background
				from Fortran IV
		XYPLOT.RA	Replaces DEC's XYPLOT for spooling
				plot files to disk
		PLOT.HL		Documentation file

DEC10 -- PDP-8 <==> PDP-10 Communication

		DEC10.PA	Source for DEC10
		DEC10.SV	Save image of DEC10
		SEND3.FA	PDP-10 macro source for PIM mode
				file send/receive
		DEC10.HL	Documentation for use of DEC10
		PROTOC.HL	Documentation of file transmission
				protocol
